description:
Returns the text of a poem in the ReadingRate collection, with numbered lines. Titles, epigraphs, dedications and stage directions are marked apart from the verse. A long work in sections, such as an epic, returns its list of sections unless a section number is given.

Use when the user asks to read or see a specific poem, or part of one. It returns only poems already in the collection; it does not write, continue or translate poems.

Examples:
- {"identifier": "wyatt/whoso-list-to-hunt"}
- {"identifier": "milton/paradise-lost", "section": 1}
